{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/21c202c55a4eddca58a5f2d8237658a4.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/99ab81f7758672e44eda845f68c473fd.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarfare: All for the Forge! is a single player first-person tower defense game. Defend against Mother Natures' hoards of enemies as they try to stop you from the ultimate goal- profit! Build towers and use weapons to protect the beacon and keep the forge safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/f7be4da7087ac61b23fd8cf1f0ad3a91.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/99ab81f7758672e44eda845f68c473fd.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a wide range of <strong><i>towers</i></strong> to defend against he hoards.<br><br>if that ain't good enough, do it yourself! Grab your choice of weapons to take out any enemies that slip through your defenses. Choose your loadout casually to synergize with your towers and playstyle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/11735d883591fd642044816d76b356c3.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/99ab81f7758672e44eda845f68c473fd.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brush up on your typing, dwarves- our technology ain't touchscreen! Utilize the terminal systems to build &amp; manage towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/890c5526693247a7eac8b3ac83e5d8f8.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/99ab81f7758672e44eda845f68c473fd.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wrath of nature never rests! Time between waves is limited, so make the most of what little time you have to repair towers, upgrade your arsenal and prepare for the next onslaught!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/68bb207a1d84134cae3d8bb6b2727ee0.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003740/extras/99ab81f7758672e44eda845f68c473fd.avif?t=1758627878\" data-has-big width=1560 height=125 /></